\pard\plain\ltrpar\s1\li360\fi-360\kerning24\fs56\lang1033\li0\fi0 {\b\f1\fs88\cf1 Problem 1 (35 pts)\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s2\li1080\fi-360\kerning24\fs48\lang1033\li360 {\pntext\pard\plain\f3\fs56 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnfs56{\pntxtb \'95}}{\f2\fs56\cf1 Implement a Priority Queue}{\f2\fs28\cf1 \par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1800\fi-360\kerning24\fs40\lang1033\li720\fi0 {\f2\fs32\cf1 You are going shopping at your local store. The aisles are organized such that each aisle contains a specific category of item. The aisles are arranged from left to right. The aisles are represented by an array of categories e.g.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1800\fi-360\kerning24\fs40\lang1033\li720\fi0 {\f2\fs32\cf1 \par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1800\fi-360\kerning24\fs40\lang1033\li720\fi0 {\f2\fs32\cf1 \tab [\'91dinner\'92, \'91lunch\'92, \'91breakfast\'92, \'91snacks\'92, \'91desserts\'92]\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1800\fi-360\kerning24\fs40\lang1033\li720\fi0 {\f2\fs32\cf1 \par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1800\fi-360\kerning24\fs40\lang1033\li720\fi0 {\f2\fs32\cf1 You want to collect as many items as you can moving through the aisles from left to right. The store owner has some very strict rules for the shoppers:\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s4\li2520\fi-360\kerning24\lang1033\li1800 {\pntext\pard\plain\f3\fs32 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnfs32{\pntxtb \'95}}{\f2\fs32\cf1 You have only 2 baskets to place your items in and each basket can hold only a single category of item.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s4\li2520\fi-360\kerning24\lang1033\li1800 {\pntext\pard\plain\f3\fs32 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnfs32{\pntxtb \'95}}{\f2\fs32\cf1 Starting from the aisle of your choice, you must select exactly one item from the aisle and place it in one of your baskets, remember that you have only 2 baskets and each basket can contain only one category of item.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s4\li2520\fi-360\kerning24\lang1033\li1800 {\pntext\pard\plain\f3\fs32 \'95\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf3\pnfs32{\pntxtb \'95}}{\f2\fs32\cf1 Once you reach an aisle that contains an item you are not allowed to put into either of your baskets you must stop shopping.\par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1800\fi-360\kerning24\fs40\lang1033\li720\fi0 {\f2\fs32\cf1 \par 
}\pard\plain\ltrpar\s3\li1800\fi-360\kerning24\fs40\lang1033\li720\fi0 {\f2\fs28\cf1 \par 
